      "widgets_values": [
        "10-second cinematic cyberpunk anime action sequence. Continue directly from the provided first frame. The first frame is the exact starting moment of the sequence.\n\nPreserve the exact appearance, face, hairstyle, clothing, cybernetic arm and Malorian Arms 3516 pistol of Johnny Silverhand. Preserve the exact enormous body proportions, armor design, mechanical limbs and silhouette of Adam Smasher. Maintain the same ruined industrial cyberpunk environment, red and blue neon lighting, smoke, dust, sparks and destroyed concrete structures.\n\nHigh-energy Japanese cyberpunk anime action cinematography, bold expressive linework, dramatic perspective, fast but readable action, strong impact frames, cinematic camera movement and physically coherent motion.\n\nIMPORTANT AUDIO REQUIREMENTS:\n\nNO BACKGROUND MUSIC.\nDO NOT generate any music, soundtrack, melody, rhythm or musical ambience.\nThere must be no BGM throughout the entire 10-second sequence.\nOnly generate natural scene audio and basic action sound effects:\n- Johnny's dialogue\n- gunshots\n- muzzle blast\n- bullet impacts\n- mechanical footsteps\n- heavy mechanical movement\n- concrete impacts\n- breaking concrete\n- debris falling\n- sparks and electrical crackling\n- smoke and environmental ambience\n- heavy metallic movement\n\nKeep all sound effects synchronized with the corresponding visual actions.\nDo not replace sound effects with music.\nDo not introduce music at the beginning or end of the clip.\nThe audio should feel like raw cinematic production sound without a soundtrack.\n\nSHOT 1 — 0s–2.5s\n\nContinue directly from the first frame.\n\nJohnny Silverhand keeps his cybernetic arm extended and fires several rapid shots from the Malorian Arms 3516 directly at Adam Smasher.\n\nBright muzzle flashes illuminate Johnny's cybernetic arm and the surrounding smoke. Multiple bullets strike Adam Smasher's heavy armor, producing bright sparks, small fragments and metallic impact sounds.\n\nJohnny shouts angrily in Chinese:\n\n“去死吧，重锤！”\n\nAudio:\nSharp pistol gunshots, metallic bullet impacts, sparks, environmental machinery hum and Johnny's voice. No music.\n\nAdam Smasher barely reacts. His enormous armored body continues advancing through the smoke.\n\nSHOT 2 — 2.5s–5s\n\nAdam Smasher suddenly accelerates toward Johnny.\n\nHeavy mechanical footsteps shake the damaged concrete floor.\n\nJohnny quickly moves sideways while firing another shot.\n\nAdam Smasher swings his enormous mechanical arm toward Johnny.\n\nJohnny narrowly dodges the attack.\n\nThe massive mechanical fist slams into the concrete wall behind Johnny.\n\nThe impact violently destroys part of the wall, sending concrete fragments, dust and sparks through the air.\n\nAudio:\nHeavy mechanical footsteps, servo motors, metallic movement, violent concrete impact, debris falling, electrical sparks and Johnny's movement. No music.\n\nSHOT 3 — 5s–7.5s\n\nJohnny immediately retreats behind the damaged concrete barrier while keeping the Malorian Arms 3516 aimed at Adam Smasher.\n\nAdam Smasher continues advancing through the smoke.\n\nJohnny fires several more shots.\n\nThe bullets strike Adam Smasher's armor but fail to stop him.\n\nJohnny briefly looks at the damaged environment and realizes that direct gunfire is not enough.\n\nJohnny says angrily in Chinese:\n\n“普通子弹……根本伤不了你。”\n\nAudio:\nGunshots, metallic impacts, mechanical footsteps, breathing, environmental ambience and debris. No music.\n\nSHOT 4 — 7.5s–10s\n\nAdam Smasher suddenly moves closer to Johnny's position.\n\nJohnny steps backward behind the damaged concrete barrier, then deliberately exposes himself for a moment to attract Adam Smasher's attention.\n\nAdam Smasher immediately focuses on Johnny and charges toward him.\n\nJohnny turns and quickly retreats deeper into the ruined facility.\n\nThe camera follows Johnny as he disappears behind smoke and broken concrete.\n\nEnd with Adam Smasher aggressively pursuing Johnny through the smoke.\n\nAudio:\nHeavy mechanical footsteps becoming louder, servo motors, concrete debris, Johnny's footsteps, environmental ambience and distant gunfire echoes.\n\nNO BACKGROUND MUSIC.\n\nEnd the clip with natural environmental sound only. Do not fade into music."
